WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:08.280
Well first of all, I and everybody else in Greenland have already seen dramatic changes in the Arctic.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:14.040
And I think when the ice is melting, which it has been during the past few years

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.660
it’s mainly the sea ice we are talking about, whereas the inland ice will not diminish significantly,

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.240
so I think if you stand on the beach looking in towards the ice cap,

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.660
it will look pretty much the same, but everything around the sea will be very different.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.280
And I think importantly it will also affect the rest of the world.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:38.600
The climate of the whole northern hemisphere is very strongly influenced by the climate in Greenland

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.860
and a lot of the climate systems are fed around Greenland

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.380
so the rest of the world will also see these changes.

